  "q3": "The advantage of 'triple R' over 'triple RC' was that it sounded more cohesive and was perceived as a single, unified product name. The group felt that 'triple R' avoided the confusion or dual meaning of 'RC' (which could be interpreted as 'remote control') and instead created a more streamlined, brand-aligned name that emphasized the product's identity as part of the 'Real Reaction' brand, making it feel more integrated and memorable."
}

